    "html": "Faction<br><br>Minor factions get a total of 24 points<br><br>Major factions get a total of 32 points<br><br>Gongsun Zan gets a total of 30 points<br><br>All Han factions now start with 2 army cap (1 in case of Liu Bei)<br><br>Added in the rest of Liu Yu's faction mechanic this includes:<br>  Adjusted Liu Yu's Northern Courage disable from being given at the start to now being based on his resource (restricted to the last two tiers of his mechanic)<br>  Qiang, Di, Xianbei, and Xiliang characters and regions<br>  Added Yan Rou to the Backbone<br><br>Added in starting missions for all playable factions (Han, Bandits, and Barbarians)<br><br>Adjusted starting location for Hua Xin, moved to weaponsmith. Should help Sun Jian<br><br>Removed Sun Jian/Sun Ce starting with Chibi<br><br>Tweaked Sun Jian starting, he now start with bad relations with Hua Xin and Liu Pan.<br><br>Added in second army of Cao Cao (Cao Hong and Cao Ren)<br><br>Added in ability to see the children in your faction<br><br>Added in new family tree view, mainly used for characters not in the family tree.<br><br>Unit<br><br>Added in new unit cards for:<br>  Bingzhou Riders (Zhang Yang)<br>  Bingzhou Raider Cavalry (Gao Gan)<br>  Immovable Blades (Gao Gan)<br>  Guardian of Hebei (Han Fu)<br>  Swiftfoot Spears (Wang Kuang)<br>  Tao Penitents (Zhang Lu)<br>  Zhenren Defenders (Zhang Lu)<br><br>Fixed Chen Wen not being able to recruit new units from Southern factions<br><br>Zhuge Xuan's Spear Upkeep bumped down from 155 to 140<br><br>Zhuge Xuan's Spear Melee Evasion bumped up from 22 to 28<br><br>Removed unit caps from unit side buildings<br><br>Added in Provincial Units<br><br>Mechanic<br><br>Added in the rest of Liu Yu's faction mechanic<br><br>Added text to Bian Rang's mechanics<br><br>Demote is now correctly limited to only Korea cultures<br><br>Removed starting dilemmas, you now need this to change the starting options (Now you use MCT)<br><br>Added in Wang Sheng's mechanic<br><br>Tweaked chance of talent triggering from battle, from 10% to 5% (10% for Ni Xiaode)<br><br>Added in Area of Recruitment (only for player)<br><br>Added in Provincial Buildings (goodbye Side Buildings)<br><br>Added in text to replace the MTU skills for specific characters<br><br>Added in new settings for MCT<br><br>Added in Sheng Xian's mechanic<br><br>Added in event for character join: (Player &amp; AI) Zhang Zhao, Zhang Hong, Zhou Yu, Yue Jin, Xu Chu, Xu Shu<br><br>Added in Fondness for a lot of different characters (mainly Liu Bei) - Rewan<br><br>Added in new MCT option, Spawn Characters for Turn 1 (spawns most of future characters on turn 1, let me know if you have any requests)<br><br>Character:<br><br>Title Changes:<br> Song Jian 25% -&gt; 20% (minister)<br> Gao Pei 35% -&gt; 40% (self)<br> Ji Ling 15% -&gt; 20% (when commanding)<br> Gao Shun 15% -&gt; 25% (when commanding)<br> Nanlou 10% -&gt; 15% (when commanding)<br> Xiahou Yuan 50% -&gt; 25% (when commanding)<br> Cao Chun 50% -&gt; 35% (Retinue)<br> Liu Dan, Song Xian, Tao Ying, Zhao Fan → Negate (self) -&gt; Retinue<br> Xiahou Dun, Gan Ning → Reflect (self) -&gt; Retinue<br> Charge Speed (Cavalry)<br> Bian Baozhai 25% -&gt; 15%<br> Ganwiego 15% -&gt; 20%<br> Tian Yu 10% -&gt; 15%<br> Ji Ling 25% (force) -&gt; (when commanding)<br> Zhang Xian 10% -&gt; 15%<br> Charge Bonus (when attacking) all units:<br> Chunyu Dan 50% -&gt; 30%<br> Lu Shang 25% -&gt; 20%<br> Niu Dan 50% -&gt; 25%<br> Charge Bonus for all (mod):<br> Minister: 15%<br> Commanding: 20%<br> Retinue: 25%<br> Self: 40%<br><br>Fixed Yuan Shu not getting his unique skill<br><br>Fixed Gongsun Zan not getting his unique skill<br><br>Added Familial Conflict to Yuan Yi<br><br>Added Specialized Forge to Zhang Yang<br><br>Fixed Wu Fan's age<br><br>Fixed Xu Dan's name<br><br>Fixed Deng Zhi's age<br><br>Fixed Du Qiong's armor being missing<br><br>Fixed Xu Dan's name again<br><br>Fixed the Character's Long Name appearing in the frontend<br><br>Fixed Sun Ren's bonus<br><br>Fixed Yue Jin's Armour<br><br>Fixed Guo Nuwang<br><br>Tweaked a lot of levels of faction leaders to be more standardized<br><br>Tweaked around with some careers<br><br>Zhang Jin<br><br>Added: Liu Min (劉敏)<br><br>Renamed: Sheng Xiang → Shentu Xiang (申屠香)<br><br>Birthdate Fix: Jiang Wan → 181<br><br>Shi Huang<br><br>Birthdates: Cheng Bing → 170; Lü Yi → 189<br><br>Zhang Xian<br> Family Tree: Song Shurou → Wife (not daughter)<br> Birthdates: Zhang Xian → 152; Pei Qian → 167<br><br>Zhu Fu<br> Family Tree: Kou Xiaolan → Wife<br> Renamed: Qi → Huangfu Qi (皇甫琪)<br><br>Wu Ju<br> Family Tree: Wu Xi → Sister<br><br>Lai Gong<br> Birthdate: 159<br> Family Tree: Add Lai Feng as Brother<br><br>Fei Zhan<br> Subculture: Gao Sheng, Li Huan → Bandits<br> Birthdate: Gao Sheng → 185<br><br>Pan Lin<br> Subculture: Hong Ming → Bandit<br><br>You Tu<br> Subculture: Li Yu, Yuan Long → Bandits<br><br>Zu Lang<br> Birthdate: 152<br> Subculture: Zou Lin → Bandit<br><br>Liu Xun<br> Birthdates: Liu Xun 156; Wang Song 158; Liu Wei 178; Liu Ye 168; Liu Fu 151; Liu Jing 181<br><br>Hu Mao<br> Heir: Niu Dan → Heir<br> Birthdates: Hu Mao 156; Deng Zhi 178; Yao Zhou 182; Dong He 168; Du Qiong 162<br> Subculture: Gan Ning’s 3 officers → Bandits<br><br>Jia Long<br> Birthdate: Li Hui → 180<br> Trait: Jia Long → Concerned (instead of Disloyal)<br> Renamed: Zhang Ying → Zhang Yi (張裔)<br><br>Zhao Wei<br> Birthdate: Yang Huai → 170<br><br>Liu Yan<br> Family Tree: Lady Wu → Married to Liu Mao (Wu family added)<br> Renamed: Lady Wu → Wu Xian (吳莧); Lady Liu → Fei Qiu (費秋)<br> Birthdates: Yan Yan 150; Dong Fu 131; Pang Xi 155; Fei Guan 181<br> Title Fix: Liu Xun → “Filial Loyalist” background<br><br>Shi Xie<br> Renamed: Lady Shi → Li Shi (李诗)<br> Birthdates: Gan Li 180; Lady Shi 140<br><br>Yuan Shu<br> Subculture: Chen Lan, Mei Cheng → Bandits<br> Birthdates: Zhou Shang 148; Yuan Anyang 178; Lady Feng 157; Yan Xiang 144<br> Renamed: Xia Lan → Xiahou Lan<br><br>Ying Shao<br> Subculture: Chang Xi → Bandit<br> Gender Fix: Ying Lun → Female<br><br>Qu Pan<br> Renamed: Zhan → Zao Zhan (早湛)<br><br>Dong Zhuo<br> Birthdate: Zhang Xiu → 163<br><br>Kong Rong<br> Title Fix: Zuo Chengxu’s title → correct Vanguard<br> Birthdates: Liu Zhen 168<br> Traits: Mi Heng → Brilliant, Artful, Arrogant<br><br>Zhang Chao<br> Moved Characters: Bi Chen, Wang Kai, Xu Si → from Chen Gui to Zhang Chao<br><br>Zhu Hao<br> Renamed: Huang Jianshuo → Huangfu Jianshuo (son of Huangfu Song)<br><br>Wang Lang<br> Birthdates: Wang Su 195 (spawns via event); Wu Can 174; Dong Xi 166; He Qi 168; Bu Zhi 172<br><br>Tao Qian<br> Birthdates: Gan Mei 174<br><br>Liu Dai<br> Birthdate: Liu Huimin 174<br><br>Chen Wen<br> Family Tree: Zhou Ang → related to Zhou family<br><br>Cao Cao<br> Added Officer: Xiahou Shang<br><br>Fixed Ding Feng spawning as a Sentinel (meant as Champion)<br><br>Fixed Zhong Hui not spawning at all<br><br>Fixed Zhang Hong's title<br><br>Fixed Cheng Bing spawning twice<br><br>Fixed Zhu Liu &amp; Xu Dan's title<br><br>Other<br><br>Added in new update log, which you will find next to the faction breakdown<br><br>Added the version instead of date to the button (at 0.87)<br><br>Fixed default settings not appearing if MCT wasn't on<br><br>Removed spy icon from a multitude of places (good luck trying to determine who is a spy now 😛)<br><br>Removed being able to recruit spies from the recruitment pool (now you need to recruit to know)<br><br>Tweaked around with some careers<br><br>Fixed Mad appearing timeless mode<br><br>Added in New Content Button in the Frontend<br><br>and more I forgot",
