    "kind": "release",
    "title": "",
    "html": "--- New Mod 190 Expanded Overhaul Addition <br><br>The mod is going to broken up into three parts, you will not need the overhaul part, but your experience will be much better. <br><br>The three parts are:<br><br>UNRELEASED (TBA)<br>190 Expanded Characters<br>190 Expanded Overhaul <br><br>The 190 Expanded Overhaul will have all the changes that require a complete overhaul to the game system, (Attribute, Buildings, Salary, etc) not required but recommended.<br><br>Main Mod Addition - <br><br>Update:<br><br>YT Skill Tree have been fixed, and no longer should disappear.<br><br>Fixed a multitude of Nanman and Fates Divided character who had the wrong AI package (Thanks Rewan) <br>\t- Many Nanman were using commander or strategist packages so the AI would use them in the backline when they should be fighting, example here would be Wutugu.<br><br>Fixed Song Jian always being declared Enemy of the Han.<br><br>Removed Salary Changes and now are moved to the Overhaul Addition.<br>Removed Faction Council Rebalancing and Scaling Cost, now are moved to the Overhaul Addition.<br><br>Overhaul Mod Addition - <br><br>Attribute Overhaul:<br><br>Each Attribute previously applied two bonuses to the character, really gearing them into a playstyle<br>\tExpertise as Early Admins <br>\tResolve as Tanks<br>\tCunning as Ammo Hoarders<br>\tInstinct as Pure Damage<br>\tAuthority as Ministers <br>\t<br>\tNow each class is good at doing specialized things. <br>\tExpertise focuses on Industry <br>\tCunning on Commerence <br>\tResolve on Peasantry <br>\tAuthority on all income <br>\tInstinct on Public Order<br>\tetc...<br>\t<br>\tHaving low attribute does apply a negative effect. <br><br>Expertise<br>Construction time (1-3) (Faction-wide)<br>Increased Industry (Admin)<br>Experience for Units (When Commanding)<br>Armor (Retinue) <br>Melee Evasion (Character)<br><br>Resolve<br><br>Food Production (Faction-wide)<br>Pesantry (Admin)<br>Reinforcement Range (When Commanding)<br>Replenishment (Retinue)<br>HP (Character)<br><br>Cunning<br><br>Trade Influence (Faction-wide)<br>Increased Commerce (Admin)<br>Miltiary Supplies (Army)<br>Ammo (Retinue)<br>Melee Evasion (Character)<br><br>Instinct<br><br>Recruitment Costa (Faction-wide)<br>Public Order (Admin)<br>Post-Battle Income (When Commanding)<br>Charge Bonus (Retinue)<br>AP/Melee Damage (Character)<br><br>Authority<br><br>Satisfaction (Faction-wide)<br>Income from all (Admin)<br>Upkeep (Retinue)<br>Morale (When Commanding)<br>Aura (Character)<br><br>Please leave your opinions and I shall change how needed.<br><br>--- <br><br>Building Overhaul.<br><br>Focuses on Han Buildings boosting the buildings with lower usage, and those with high usage gain punishing effects.",
