    "html": ":<br><br>Armor has been changed to higher quality ones but specific to one class, after some time I will start creating armour art for each character.<br>Added in agrees/disagrees for newly added titles. <br>Fixed Pang De's background<br>Added one new bonus to Shi Xie (+50% Family Estate) <br>Fixed Crossbows t-posing. (Need Alex's Animation Mod for this to work properly)<br><br>Dong Zhuo extended event can now be disabled via the Setup Process at the start of the turn. [Will be looking into a much better way of doing this.] <br>\tDZ event has also been optimized by me so maybe it won't crash lol<br>\tOtherwise if you choose to not have the extended event, Li Jue will take over.<br><br>Faction Council:<br><br>Rebalanced cost of many faction council items.<br>\tNo longer can you spend a mere 200 gold for a major buff instead it scales to your game stage.<br>\t\t- Turn 25, the cost increase by 1.5. Turn 75, it increases by 75. <br>\t\t- Your Progression Level also increases the price. <br>\tLooters are rarer and more costly. <br>\tIncreased income threshold for the three types of income. No longer can you pull all 3 income increases.",
