    "title": "[THIS UPDATE NOW NEED DRUNKEN PANDA'S MODELS TO WORK]",
    "html": "<br>North West Update <br><br>5 Units added<br>2 Gao Gan <br>2 Gan Ning<br>1 Restricted to Xiliang Commander Follower (All Han Factions)<br><br>--<br><br>50 + characters added <br>Dong Zhuo Civil War event improved! (Needs more testing.) <br>Starting turn options!<br>\t- Historical/AHistoric deaths<br>\t- Abandoned Land given to Looters<br>\t- Nanman options (Left alone, group up depending on faction, all under one faction, or destroy all nanman)! <br><br>-- <br><br>Character Changes:<br><br>Ma Teng loses Cruel because that makes no sense for him to have. (Gains Kind)<br>Ma Chao loses Fratenal and gains Cruel, again makes no sense for Ma Chao to have Fratenal since his actions got his family killed.<br>Huang Shao loses stalk faction-wide, and gains Snipe instead, boosting his experience, while stalk is added to his armor for his retinue.<br>Liu Yan's title has changed to include a missing effect (Losing Peasantry in turn for +100% Family Estate)  [Fun fact this is apart of base game but not active for some reason?]<br>Sun Ce loses bonus to colonize for half price due to AI being able to colonize for free. :)<br>Added Anti Traits for Frivolous (Total of 8) No more Sentinels always getting it.<br>Fixed Ying Yang(Chang) title to be historically accurate. Previously Chess Grandmaster, now Master of Harmonies.<br>Zhang Lu now has Sima Liang's portrait <br>Bows are now locked to their users. (Will be doing a poll in discord on if I should add a new slot for accessories and bows.) <br><br>Yellow Turbans can be captured as Han and recruited now. <br>\t- This will be tweaked in a future update. <br><br>---<br><br>Salary Changes(This is to help with the amount of characters and to make titles useful):<br><br>Character Salary has decreased:<br>Base: \t  150 --&gt; 50<br>Governor: 250 --&gt; 150<br>Minister: 350 --&gt; 250<br><br>Family Members now have salary <br>Base 0 --&gt; 25<br>Governor Family 250 --&gt; 125<br>Minister Family 350 --&gt; 225<br><br>Generic Titles:<br><br>All Titles from the menu have been lower in salary and slightly tweaked. <br>\tMost Titles are useless due to the cost and effects so they have been changed.<br>\tMore titles are on the way, <br>\t\t- Faction-wide <br>\t\t- Retinue<br>\t\t- Admin <br>\t\t- Army <br>\t\t<br>\tPossible system to auto add these onto characters<br><br>--<br><br>2 Follower added <br><br>\tXiliang Commander (Limit of 4 on the Field)<br>\t\tUnlocks Xiliang units and a unique Xiliang Commander to be recruited.<br>\tWeapon Crafter (Limit of 4 on the Field) <br>\t\tGives the ability to get weapons on round start.<br>\t\tOnly one of these count. <br><br>4 Weapons added<br><br>\tHua Xiong's Glaive<br>\tXu Rong's Axe<br>\tPang De's Spear<br>\tMa Dai's Halberd <br>\t<br>1 Accessory :<br><br>Scripture of the Five Pecks of Rice for Zhang Lu.<br>\t<br>Restored Items: <br><br>3k_main_ancillary_accessory_king_of_jade_ge<br>3k_dlc04_ancillary_accessory_calligraphy_set_unique<br>3k_dlc04_ancillary_accessory_religious_bell_unique<br><br>Restored two unused art works to proper followers: <br><br>3k_dlc04_ancillary_follower_apprentice_crafter<br>3k_dlc04_ancillary_follower_master_crafter<br><br>Generic Titles: (Han/Nanman/Bandits/YTs) <br><br>All title have been boosted to 30 base.<br><br>between 3 categories:<br><br>Basic Titles have 30 wuxing points<br>(Nanman-Only Below)<br>Exceptional Titles have 40 wuxing points<br>Rare titles have 50 wuxing points. <br><br>Almost all Titles have opinions now.<br>Nanman Titles now have proper opinions than just all favoring Intelligence and Cunning.<br><br>--<br><br>Ceo Changes:<br><br>Character will have set bonuses with their unique items, these will be slowly added. This is mainly for keeping weapons on their proper users, and if you don't you lose a key bonus of the weapon. <br><br>Lu Bu: Amongst Men<br>Zhang Lu: Scripture of the Master<br>\t<br>-- Followers<br><br>There are 4 followers that add Satisfaction, I want to change these to be two, <br>\tHua Tuo (10+)<br>\tConcubine (10+)<br>\tLegalist Fanatic (6+)<br>\tPhilosopher (10+)<br>\t<br>\tHua Tuo has been changed to +1 Resilience faction-wide<br>\tConcubine has been lower to +5 satisfaction for the character, with a replenishment bonus faction-wide <br>\t<br>These are some of the first changes I am making to the followers. <br>\t<br>General Changes<br><br>Elite Trainer has been given 50% Character Experience to the character.<br>Professor has been changed to Experience as it makes no sense for him to have trade influence. <br>Master Craftsmen has been changed to Commerce as an Industry item in it's tier exists in Forge Master.<br>Labour Recruiter decreased from 8 to 4, due to how common this follower is.<br><br>Traits:<br><br>Vain has been decreased from 25% to 15%<br><br>Armour: <br><br>All Generic armour has lost negative attribute effects, keeping the movement reduction. <br>\t<br>---<br><br>--<br><br>New Mechanic:<br><br>Spouses now provide bonuses to their husbands, this is being tested limitly right now with the Northwest factions. Characters included are:<br><br>Lady Yang (Ma Chao's Wife)<br>Lady Yan (Lu Bu's Wife)<br>Lady Zou (Zhang Ji's Wife)<br>Lady Du (Qin Yilu's Wife) <br>Lady Lu Ji (Lu Bu's Daughter) <br>Lady Dong Peishan (Dong Zhuo's Wife)<br>Lady Dong Bai (Dong Zhuo's Granddaughter) <br>Lady Dong Li (Dong Zhuo's daughter) <br>Lady Bi Jieyan (Zhang Lu's Wife) <br>Lady Yu Minxiang (Jia Long's Wife) <br>Diaochan <br><br>You can see the bonuses applied on the character when in the character details on the same row as their age. (Thanks to waxgourd and his mod: <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2937215684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2937215684</a> for this method) <br><br>--<br><br>Faction Changes:<br><br>AI Liu Bei is no longer Dependent, meaning he will be less likely to become a vassal.  (Needs testing)<br>Liu Bei's Path to Unity nerfed once again due to it being given to AI at the start. <br>Many AI factions given region hints which will make them challenge other factions for certain regions.<br><br>YTs:<br><br>AI and MP He Yi gets the: Book of People<br>AI and MP Gong Du gets the: Book of Earth<br>AI and MP Huang Shao gets the: Book of Heaven<br><br>-- Gao Gan <br><br>Resource Changes: <br><br>Move Melee Evasion to self<br>+ Trade Influence<br>- Construction Cost<br><br>Give Unique Conscription <br>+ Retinue Deployment (0 - 2)<br>- Population ( 5 - 20 ) <br>+ Starting Ranks ( 1 - 3 ) <br>+ Replenishment (5 - 15) <br><br>--- Liu Yu<br><br>Changed from increased unit upkeep to reduced. Will be changed to Increased Upkeep outside of friendly territory.<br>Add reduced recruitment of Milita units.<br><br>Bugs fixed:<br><br>Yufuluo colonization fixed. <br>\t- He should be getting his resource from capturing territory.<br>\t<br>Fixed added positions not increasing the salary of character. <br><br>List of Bugs spotted:<br><br>Han Chong doesn't have his portrait fully looking into this.",
